      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵，别这么激动嘛。\n而且就算我跟你约好了明天会去──",
      "source_fingerprint": "faa242dfaedc90db08da38653aa8f19919f8aba85c405937a4873c0e5312df92",
