    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:280b5ec53452a8a8ecb07c9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能体验到赛马娘的神秘之处，\n对训练员而言没有比这更棒的经验了。\n你不这么认为吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "794d06f9edd697767277eb98a876a75e1b001e555e06052a1f26996d80a440cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cf5ce40393ac05575ccbec5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由于太过惊讶，我甚至没有注意到\n穿戴装罝跟耳机的存在。\n正当我打算把穿戴装置拿下时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0a77573debd3bc4ed78d52e1158d0da3cae3e4d53007285a731aceada3c6b90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dbb0c3c8f31a70ac78286f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子来探病时只待了五分钟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec15933c173ed4a486e6dc72f5b9d5964c97221176310427c65fc8310d359993",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05d124dbd293c1d396c31171",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论如何，我和爱丽速子一起寻找\n“赛马娘可能性的尽头”的日子\n就此开始了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba9f7bc1bde8e5ac8f1370da25a6d49f7ee22161a9a8477792d140b0bbda9ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b3401823c45a6e0d10b2708",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实、实验内容是什么！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "013c8be4feabd564be91d51e92621578d47a7ad74bdac10933542a1af36636ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
