      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09254307b97937ad4a8ce202",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "假设身为一般人类的你，\n得到了跟一般赛马娘同等的肉体时，\n你的脑功能跟赛马娘的肉体能配合到什么程度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b4f21a198c5fd866b6aac7657302750bc96d88918e479963e3964f567495eaa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14268794df662fe5f64d5b0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01f5157ab6084fd2d62a9b2fb3ed2265f23d3165818db7e0077dea5999701a65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4074a005dfadb7a70c57de74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天是新年。虽然我知道相较于其他赛马娘，\n她依然对比赛没有太多的热情──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f69fd4a6525848a861242dd3144051cbf79869d6e517373f8b9e391f3381aed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39998660baf81c200724a794",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便如此，我还是把今年的目标\n订为“经典三冠”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c78a12475b54cf4a795524652dec05d90cbe395c97de677ea433e69042e0d57",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
